# CLI sidecar staged by scripts/stage-cli-sidecar.mjs before tauri dev/build
# Without a trailing slash, so it also matches the *symlink* a git worktree needs
# to build: `binaries/` ignores a directory only, so `git add -A` in a worktree
# happily committed the link — and CI, where its target does not exist, failed
# `mkdir` on a dangling symlink before any test ran, on all three platform legs.
src-tauri/binaries

# Verified llama.cpp runtime staged by scripts/stage-managed-runtime.mjs.
# The small README stays tracked so Tauri's resource glob also resolves
# during plain cargo test/check runs that do not execute the staging script.
src-tauri/resources/managed-runtime/*
!src-tauri/resources/managed-runtime/README.md

